        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium alloy, AlMg3, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium alloy, AlMg3, at plant
The production of AlMg3 is investigated with the content of different metals used for the alloy. This aluminium alloy contains 3% of magnesium.;
Synonyms: AA 5754, EN AW-5754; 
UUID: 15e202fc-ad29-3de6-8ec0-a9ce3d9ff6fb
Production of alloy from primary metals, no extra infrastructure.
Location: Data for 1 producer
Technology: Production of aluminium-magnesium alloy from primary metals, no recycling of input materials.
Time period: Environmental report
Production volume: ca. 146000t/a
Sampling: Environmental data for an important producer 
Extrapolations: From 1 producer to average Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_15e202fc-ad29-3de6-8ec0-a9ce3d9ff6fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
